@startuml
title Scheduler xử lý đơn PayOS hết hạn
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ParticipantBorderColor #222222
  ActorBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ActorBorderColor #222222
  BoundaryBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  BoundaryBorderColor #222222
  ControlBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ControlBorderColor #222222
  EntityBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  EntityBorderColor #222222
  LifeLineBorderColor #666666
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  MessageAlign center
}

control Scheduler
control PaymentService
entity PostgreSQL
entity PayOSProvider
entity PayOS

Scheduler->PaymentService: Cron every minute
PaymentService->PostgreSQL: Find creating or pending attempts
PostgreSQL-->PaymentService: Expired payment attempts
PaymentService->PayOSProvider: Reconcile payment link
PayOSProvider->PayOS: Query link status and paid amount
PayOS-->PayOSProvider: Link status and aggregate amount
PayOSProvider-->PaymentService: Provider result
PaymentService->PostgreSQL: Lock order and attempt
PaymentService->PaymentService: Decide paid, expired, or review
PaymentService->PostgreSQL: Mark paid or cancel known unpaid order
PaymentService->PostgreSQL: Release voucher through cancelled state
PaymentService-->Scheduler: Reconciliation result
@enduml
